<title>HONG KONG: China Everbright-IHD seeks investments.</title>
<headline>China Everbright-IHD seeks investments.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd said it was exploring investment opportunities and various negotiations were currently at a preliminary stage.</p>
<p>But it said no binding agreements had yet been reached.</p>
<p>China Everbright made the announcement at the request of the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>On Thursday its shares rose HK$0.35 to HK$2.00.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
